      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Freedom%2C_California",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1982 members of the Order of E Clampus Vitus hung a sign proclaiming the town’s new name, Freedom.",
